{"title":"Ogre","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 35 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (7.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/de2767c208093a1cb5d6.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/041bc901a74a756926db.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 2 looted corpses, 11 recorded drops, 228 total, 7–41 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"scroll-fireball\" title=\"Scroll Fireball - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fireball</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Ogre Den</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 9</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-58\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(3)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ogre-mage\"><img src=\"data/img/e9a0e6b2f18691365a1e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Ogre Mage</b><span>Lv 33</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ogre-traitor\"><img src=\"data/img/6c240bdea4103383ba68.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Ogre Traitor</b><span>Lv 34</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/grumbo\"><img src=\"data/img/2e16a0e229a12336b2d0.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Grumbo</b><span>Lv 35</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ogre: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">Ogre Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">Ogre Butcher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">Ogre Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/ec5ecde5e79f4b9bd162.webp\" alt=\"Ogre\"></div><h3>Ogre</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>35 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 31–35)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ogre</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>152</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>23.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>14 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}